# Claude Code session state -- must not flip provenance git_dirty
.claude/

# GPU-only diagnostics that live untracked on the VM (probe_mem.py,
# probe_snap2.py, probe_msa*.py). git_dirty comes from `git status --porcelain`,
# which counts untracked files, so leaving these visible stamps git_dirty: true
# on every artifact and makes a run unreproducible from its commit alone.
# probe_params.py is tracked and unaffected.
probe_mem.py
probe_snap.py
probe_snap2.py
probe_msa.py
probe_msa2.py
probe_msa3.py

